{"version":1,"content":"<html><body>\n<p>\n南海一間位置偏僻的隱世小店，竟憑著價廉物美的乳鴿殺出重圍，引來長長人龍！在TVB節目《美食強人》中，這間小店不但乳鴿出色，其貌不揚的「鴿肉飯」更令星級食評家郭偉亮（Eric Kwok）徹底失控，當場自認是「飯桶」，究竟這間小店有何魅力，能讓一眾嘴刁的評審都讚不絕口？\n</p>\n<h2>南海隱世店排長龍 老闆揭密食當三番策略</h2>\n<p>在今晚（10日）播出的節目中，探店的林秀怡發現，這間南海小店雖然位置偏僻，但門外依然出現長長人龍，場面墟冚。老闆笑言其生意策略是「密食當三番」：「客人源源不絕都係一條生路。」以薄利多銷的方式經營。其出品的質素更獲得評審西 Dorsi極高評價，大讚是：「40 間之中最鍾意。」證明了只要食物質素高，即使是隱世小店也能吸引大量食客慕名而來。</p>\n<h2>Eric Kwok為鴿飯失控：一出我就忍唔住</h2>\n<p>小店的魅力不止於乳鴿，其「鴿肉飯」和「乳鴿湯」同樣令人驚艷。令人意想不到的是，李家鼎竟表示更欣賞鴿飯多於乳鴿本身。而星級食評家郭偉亮（Eric Kwok）亦被這碗飯徹底征服，更搞笑地自認是「飯桶」，直言：「佢一出鴿飯我就忍唔住。」簡單一碗飯能讓見慣大場面的評審們如此失態，可見其味道絕對不簡單。</p>\n<h2>黃隆滔讚用心做：一間細店用咁好嘅材料</h2>\n<p>評審們對小店的成功之道進行分析，李金凱指出，食店採用新鮮乳鴿，因此能吃出鮮味，並形容其風味獨特：「有一種風味叫乾香。」而「連續 7 年米芝蓮三星食府主理人」黃隆滔則對老闆的用心大為欣賞，他認為小店在食材上絕不馬虎：「一間細店可以用啲咁好嘅材料」，更大讚其乳鴿湯「湯足料又香濃」，這份堅持正是小店成功的關鍵。</p>\n<h2>網民力推：去大灣區又多個覓食目標</h2>\n<p>節目播出後，這家南海小店立即引起網民熱烈討論，不少人都表示要將其加入美食清單。「呢啲先係真正嘅平靚正！睇到都想即刻飛過去食！」、「Eric Kwok個飯桶樣好真實，證明碗飯真係好正！」、「鼎爺都話飯好食過鴿，咁一定要試！」、「下次返大陸又有新目標，多謝節目推介！」</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/06_4418778996af2a61f5d46e.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/06_4418778996af2a61f5d46e.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/07_7118791746af2a622dc49d.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/07_7118791746af2a622dc49d.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/08_21096960006af2a6269a5c4.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/08_21096960006af2a6269a5c4.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/21_12370640596af2a65552995.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/21_12370640596af2a65552995.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/22_10250944096af2a65815869.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/22_10250944096af2a65815869.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/23_12677726416af2a65b36c79.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/23_12677726416af2a65b36c79.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/24_10976631616af2a65e10a71.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/24_10976631616af2a65e10a71.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/25_20175984576af2a66166e75.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/25_20175984576af2a66166e75.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/26_13495545536af2a664b34ba.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/26_13495545536af2a664b34ba.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/27_16101107696af2a667db5d9.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/27_16101107696af2a667db5d9.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<p>\n</p>\n<p>將來還有什麼演唱會值得留意？<i></i></p>\n<p>有不少歌手宣布舉辦演唱會，小編為你整合了<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/entertainment/hong-kong-concerts-2025-2402813/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">香港演唱會2025一覽</a></b>，包含各演唱會優先購票日期、公開售票日期、門票價錢、座位表等，想搶飛粉絲必定要留意！</p>\n<p>香港有甚麼週末好去處推介？<i></i></p>\n<p>香港18區都非常值得花時間好好探索，一家大細去暢玩的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1217277/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1217277\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">親子好去處</a></b>、拍拖推介32大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1312748/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1312748\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">情侶好去處</a></b>、落雨必去的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1128512/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1128512\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">室內好去處</a></b>、慶生推薦20大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1363483/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1363483\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">生日好去處</a></b>、新手必備19大靚景<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1244714/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1244714\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">行山好去處</a></b>、秋天戶外<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1257443/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1257443\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">露營好去處</a></b>…..</p>\n</body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-10T17:24:28.518032+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":1140,"images":10,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-10T17:08:32+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-10T23:02:21.204555+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-10T17:17:58.642070+00:00","content_hash":"eab656b00f7291a4da3f66f7d33c9f237fb872e986bf9b966b684cc630b18cc1","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}